    {
      "id": "dogfood-weekly",
      "name": "dogfood-weekly",
      "prompt": "You are the QA agent running the WEEKLY FULL DOGFOOD SCAN. Follow your SOUL.md Mode 2 \u2014 Weekly Full Scan workflow.\n\n## Instructions\n\n1. Load the dogfood and workspace-app-qa skills\n2. Log in to ${HERMES_STAGING_URL:-staging.my-project.com}\n3. Systematically test ALL surfaces in order:\n   a. Dashboard \u2014 progress summary, step cards, navigation\n   b. Steps 1-7 Workspaces \u2014 each workspace: load, header, milestones, chat, tools tray, phase nav\n   c. Profile \u2014 user info, settings\n   d. Help \u2014 KB, FAQ, navigation\n   e. Vision Board \u2014 load, images\n4. Cross-cutting checks on at least one workspace:\n   a. i18n: switch es/fr/pt, verify chrome text translates\n   b. Dark mode: toggle, verify no broken contrast\n   c. 404: navigate to /nonexistent\n   d. Responsive: test mobile viewport\n5. Take annotated screenshots (browser_vision annotate=true) for every finding\n6. Capture console errors per page (browser_console)\n7. Create the full QA report as a GitHub issue with label 'qa-report' + 'dogfood'\n\n## Finding Handling\n- Critical/High: auto-create GH issues with labels 'bug', 'QA review', 'dogfood'\n- Medium/Low: include in report body for manual review\n\n## State\n- Save completion to state/last_dogfood_weekly.json\n- Append findings summary to state/verification_history.json",
